description:
Manage your own tools (only yours; your definition and other agents do not change). Changes work from your next turn. One op per call:
- list: {"op": "ls"}  (add "long": true to also see tools you turned off)
- show one: {"op": "get", "name": "math"}
- add: {"op": "add", "path": "tools/math"}  (path is a tool folder; relative paths start at your workspace)
- remove or turn off any of your tools, even one you started with: {"op": "rm", "name": "wall_clock"}
- back to your original tool box (undo every add and rm, also turns removed tools back on): {"op": "reset"}
Errors: ArgumentsBad, OpUnknown, PathMissing, ToolExists (add "replace": true to replace it), ToolMissing, DaemonMissing, DaemonFailed, InstanceMissing. Details: memory me.json#/self_tools.
